WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.292
I knew I should
have had butterflies

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:02.460
about Harry Hamilton.

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.672
That’s what’s normal.

00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:08.508
But, I never did.

00:00:10.093 --> 00:00:12.137
  I had those feelings—

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:16.391
  I have those feelings...

00:00:17.058 --> 00:00:18.768
about girls.

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:22.939
And, I tried to
  be like you...

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:25.442
but I’m just not.

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:28.153
  Mother walked in on me...

00:00:29.237 --> 00:00:30.780
in New York,
with a maid.

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:36.244
She looked at me
like I was a monster.

00:00:36.244 --> 00:00:38.371
Mabel, I’m so sorry.

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:41.875
What did she say?

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:43.877
  She just...

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:46.421
walked back out,

00:00:46.421 --> 00:00:47.922
like I was nothing.

00:00:49.758 --> 00:00:51.634
Mabel, listen to me.

00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:54.179
Listen.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.640
  You’re talking about...

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:02.020
love.

00:01:08.318 --> 00:01:10.904
How can love
  ever be wrong?

00:01:11.321 --> 00:01:14.574
If that’s what gives
 you butterflies,

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:17.202
then you are exactly who
you’re supposed to be.

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:20.121
You’re Mabel.

00:01:20.121 --> 00:01:21.581
You’re beautiful.

00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:24.501
You’re not disgusted?

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:25.835
  Darling...

00:01:27.378 --> 00:01:28.963
Shame?

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:31.800
You have to try
and let that go.

00:01:34.511 --> 00:01:37.430
You’re too lovely
 to be ruined.

00:01:39.557 --> 00:01:41.643
Thank you for telling me.

